  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_CorellianHound</defName>
    <label>corellian hound</label>
    <description>Corellian hounds, also known as 'Sibian hounds' or 'Snarlers', were a type of stout canidae from the planet Corellia. They were quick and nimble canines used by locals for a number of tasks although they were often used for hunting and tracking. They had a vicious bark and bite, which meant they could be quite effective for protection.</description>
